  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:97219",
  "description": "FreeRDP is a free implementation of the Remote Desktop Protocol (RDP), released under the Apache license. The xfreerdp client can connect to RDP servers such as Microsoft Windows machines, xrdp, and VirtualBox.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * freerdp: FreeRDP: Denial of Service via endless blocking loop in Stream_EnsureCapacity (CVE-2026-27951)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Update freerdp to the latest upstream stable release (JIRA:RHEL-80426)\n  * FreeRDP does not create context for hostnames longer than 31 characters (JIRA:RHEL-143809)\n  * SSL warnings under FIPS (JIRA:RHEL-140202)\n  * [RFE] Add RDP Smart Card Redirection Support (MS?RDPESC) to Enable Remote (Virtualized) SmartCard?Based PKINIT Authentication (JIRA:RHEL-171999)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.  \n\nAdditional Changes:  \n\nFor detailed information on changes in this release, see the AlmaLinux 10 Release Notes linked from the References section.\n",
